{"seq":5,"slug":"qos-policies","title":"ROS 2 QoS 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/qos-policies","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ros-2-qos-策略\">ROS 2 QoS 策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ROS 2 的 QoS（Quality of Service）策略基于 DDS 标准，允许开发者对每个话题的通信行为进行细粒度控制。QoS 策略决定了消息的可靠性、持久性、历史深度和生命周期等关键属性，直接影响机器人系统的实时性和数据完整性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[QoS 策略] --&gt; B[可靠性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[持久性]&#10;    A --&gt; D[历史]&#10;    A --&gt; E[截止时间]&#10;    A --&gt; F[存活性]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Reliable]&#10;    B --&gt; H[Best Effort]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Volatile]&#10;    C --&gt; J[Transient Local]&#10;    D --&gt; K[Keep Last N]&#10;    D --&gt; L[Keep All]\">graph TD\n    A[QoS 策略] --&gt; B[可靠性]\n    A --&gt; C[持久性]\n    A --&gt; D[历史]\n    A --&gt; E[截止时间]\n    A --&gt; F[存活性]\n    B --&gt; G[Reliable]\n    B --&gt; H[Best Effort]\n    C --&gt; I[Volatile]\n    C --&gt; J[Transient Local]\n    D --&gt; K[Keep Last N]\n    D --&gt; L[Keep All]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>QoS 策略</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reliability</td>\n<td>Reliable / Best Effort</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>丢包重传 vs 低延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Durability</td>\n<td>Volatile / Transient Local</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>是否为后连接者保存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>History</td>\n<td>Keep Last / Keep All</td>\n<td>Keep Last(10)</td>\n<td>缓冲区管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deadline</td>\n<td>Duration</td>\n<td>∞</td>\n<td>消息到达频率保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Liveliness</td>\n<td>Automatic / Manual</td>\n<td>Automatic</td>\n<td>节点存活检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lifespan</td>\n<td>Duration</td>\n<td>∞</td>\n<td>消息有效期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预定义-qos-配置\">预定义 QoS 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;rclcpp/rclcpp.hpp&gt;&#10;&#10;auto default_qos = rclcpp::QoS(10);&#10;&#10;auto sensor_qos = rclcpp::SensorDataQoS();&#10;// Best Effort + Volatile + Keep Last(5)&#10;&#10;auto param_qos = rclcpp::ParametersQoS();&#10;// Reliable + Transient Local + Keep Last(1000)&#10;&#10;auto service_qos = rclcpp::ServicesQoS();&#10;// Reliable + Volatile + Keep Last(10)&#10;&#10;auto custom_qos = rclcpp::QoS(rclcpp::KeepLast(20))&#10;    .reliability(rclcpp::ReliabilityPolicy::BestEffort)&#10;    .durability(rclcpp::DurabilityPolicy::Volatile)&#10;    .deadline(std::chrono::milliseconds(100))&#10;    .liveliness(rclcpp::LivelinessPolicy::Automatic)&#10;    .liveliness_lease_duration(std::chrono::seconds(5));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;rclcpp/rclcpp.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> default_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensor_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SensorDataQoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Best Effort + Volatile + Keep Last(5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> param_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ParametersQoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Reliable + Transient Local + Keep Last(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServicesQoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Reliable + Volatile + Keep Last(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> custom_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KeepLast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reliability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReliabilityPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::BestEffort)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">durability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DurabilityPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Volatile)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chrono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">milliseconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">liveliness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LivelinessPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Automatic)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">liveliness_lease_duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chrono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">seconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预定义 Profile</th>\n<th>Reliability</th>\n<th>Durability</th>\n<th>History</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Default</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(10)</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SensorData</td>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(5)</td>\n<td>传感器数据流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parameters</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>Keep Last(1000)</td>\n<td>参数服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Services</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(10)</td>\n<td>服务调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SystemDefault</td>\n<td>系统默认</td>\n<td>系统默认</td>\n<td>系统默认</td>\n<td>DDS 原生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"qos-兼容性\">QoS 兼容性</h2><p>当发布者和订阅者的 QoS 策略不兼容时，DDS 将拒绝建立连接。关键兼容性规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发布者</th>\n<th>订阅者</th>\n<th>兼容</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>双方确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>订阅者降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>订阅者要求更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>双方不确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>双方持久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>订阅者不需要历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>发布者不保存历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>兼容性遵循&quot;提供方至少满足请求方要求&quot;的原则。发布者可以提供比订阅者要求更高的服务质量（如 Reliable 发布者 + Best Effort 订阅者），但不能反过来。在调试连接问题时，<code>ros2 topic info -v</code> 命令可以显示所有发布者和订阅者的 QoS 设置以及兼容性状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景-qos-配置\">典型场景 QoS 配置</h2><p>不同的机器人子系统对通信质量有不同的要求：</p>\n<p><strong>传感器数据流</strong>（激光雷达、摄像头）：使用 Best Effort + Volatile。传感器数据具有时效性——如果一帧数据丢失，等待重传没有意义，因为更新的数据已经到来。Keep Last(1) 或 Keep Last(5) 保证订阅者始终处理最新数据。</p>\n<p><strong>控制指令</strong>（cmd_vel、关节命令）：使用 Reliable + Volatile。控制指令不能丢失——一个丢失的速度指令可能导致机器人撞墙。但不需要 Transient Local，因为旧的控制指令对新连接者没有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>地图和参数</strong>：使用 Reliable + Transient Local。后连接的节点需要获取之前发布的地图或参数。Transient Local 确保迟到的订阅者也能收到最后一次发布的数据。</p>\n<p><strong>诊断和日志</strong>：使用 Best Effort + Volatile。诊断信息丢失不会影响系统安全，使用低开销的 QoS 避免占用通信带宽。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子系统</th>\n<th>Reliability</th>\n<th>Durability</th>\n<th>History</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>激光雷达</td>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(1)</td>\n<td>实时性优先，丢帧无影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制指令</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(1)</td>\n<td>不能丢失，但不需要历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态地图</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Transient Local</td>\n<td>Keep Last(1)</td>\n<td>新节点需要获取已有地图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TF 变换</td>\n<td>Reliable</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(100)</td>\n<td>需要一段时间窗口的变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诊断信息</td>\n<td>Best Effort</td>\n<td>Volatile</td>\n<td>Keep Last(5)</td>\n<td>低优先级，避免占用带宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时性配置\">实时性配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"auto realtime_qos = rclcpp::QoS(rclcpp::KeepLast(1))&#10;    .reliability(rclcpp::ReliabilityPolicy::BestEffort)&#10;    .durability(rclcpp::DurabilityPolicy::Volatile)&#10;    .deadline(std::chrono::milliseconds(10))&#10;    .lifespan(std::chrono::milliseconds(50));&#10;&#10;auto sub = create_subscription&lt;Control&gt;(&quot;cmd_vel&quot;, realtime_qos,&#10;    [this](Control::UniquePtr msg) { execute_control(std::move(msg)); });&#10;&#10;rclcpp::QoSEventCallbackGroup qos_events;&#10;rclcpp::SubscriptionOptions sub_options;&#10;sub_options.event_callbacks.deadline_callback =&#10;    [](rclcpp::QOSDeadlineRequestedInfo &amp;event) {&#10;        RCLCPP_WARN(get_logger(), &quot;Deadline missed: %d total&quot;,&#10;                    event.total_count);&#10;    };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> realtime_qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QoS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KeepLast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reliability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReliabilityPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::BestEffort)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">durability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DurabilityPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Volatile)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chrono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">milliseconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lifespan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chrono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">milliseconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sub </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_subscription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Control</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cmd_vel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, realtime_qos,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Control</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UniquePtr</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute_control</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)); });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::QoSEventCallbackGroup qos_events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::SubscriptionOptions sub_options;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sub_options.event_callbacks.deadline_callback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [](</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rclcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QOSDeadlineRequestedInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        RCLCPP_WARN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get_logger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Deadline missed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    event.total_count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Deadline 策略定义了消息必须到达的最大时间间隔。如果在 deadline 时间内没有收到新消息，DDS 触发 deadline missed 事件。配合回调函数可以实现看门狗机制——检测传感器掉线或通信中断。</p>\n<p>Lifespan 策略定义消息的有效期限——超过 lifespan 的消息会被 DDS 自动丢弃，即使还在缓冲区中。这防止了订阅者处理过期数据，对安全关键系统尤为重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ROS 2 QoS 基于 DDS 标准，提供可靠性、持久性、历史、截止时间等多维配置</li>\n<li>传感器数据使用 Best Effort 降低延迟，控制指令使用 Reliable 保证送达</li>\n<li>发布者和订阅者的 QoS 策略必须兼容，否则 DDS 拒绝建立连接</li>\n<li>不同子系统根据时效性、安全性和带宽需求选择不同的 QoS 组合</li>\n<li>Deadline 和 Liveliness 策略是实时机器人系统的关键安全保障</li>\n<li>Lifespan 策略防止订阅者处理过期数据，提升安全关键系统的可靠性</li>\n<li>合理的 QoS 配置需要在可靠性和实时性之间根据场景需求做出权衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ROS 2 QoS 策略","id":"ros-2-qos-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预定义 QoS 配置","id":"预定义-qos-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"QoS 兼容性","id":"qos-兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景 QoS 配置","id":"典型场景-qos-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"实时性配置","id":"实时性配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ROS2 QoS 与实时通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/qos-and-realtime"},"next":{"title":"ROS 2 导航栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/ros2-navigation-stack"}}